Zenith DAW
==========

Copyright (C) 2025 Micah Cooley <micahcooley@protonmail.com>

Zenith DAW is a Digital Audio Workstation designed for Linux operating systems.
It provides professional audio recording, editing, mixing, and mastering
capabilities with an emphasis on user experience and performance.

