Technology Stack
----------------

- Programming Language: C++17
- Build System: CMake 3.28+
- UI Framework: JUCE with Skia rendering
- Audio Engine: Custom cross-platform audio engine
- Plugin Format: VST3
- Version Control: Git
- Operating System: Linux (primary focus)

